            {"q": "What integrity checks exist?", "a": "SQLite: <code>PRAGMA integrity_check</code>. Postgres: real <code>pg_catalog</code> probes for invalid indexes, unvalidated constraints, and FK orphans. Admin Overview runs Check DB integrity with method + backend reported."},
            {"q": "How are embeddings stored?", "a": "pgvector extension on Postgres 16 (<code>pgvector/pgvector:pg16</code> image). Entity embeddings for CVEs, techniques, and campaigns with <code>content_hash</code> drift re-embed on backfill. SQLite tests skip vector-specific paths."},
