            {"q": "How does stack backfill work?", "a": "<code>STACK_BACKFILL_ENABLED</code> opt-in historical NVD+KEV+EPSS for shallow stack coverage. Checkpointed per product with atomic <code>claim_run_running</code> gate. Procrastinate can defer resume after NVD rate limits."},
