            {"q": "How does KEV backlog appear?", "a": "Scheduler <code>kev_backlog_reconcile</code> and <code>detection/backlog.py</code> emit <code>kev_backlog</code> notifications deep-linking to Forge <code>?view=backlog</code>. Surfaces gaps between KEV and detection coverage."},
