            {"q": "What UI primitives are standard?", "a": "Radix: Checkbox, Switch, Dialog, Select, Tabs, DropdownMenu, Tooltip, Popover, ScrollArea\u2014styled with design tokens. Zero native <code>&lt;select&gt;</code> or checkbox inputs in new code (grep gates in verify-local)."},
